 ## How it works
-The core objective is to optimize the weights $W$ of an MLP scene representation such that it can fit a new scene's data $D_{new}$ in $K$ steps, where $K \ll K_{standard}$ [S1, unofficial].
+The core objective is to optimize the weights of an MLP scene representation such that it can fit a new scene's data in $K$ steps, where $K \ll K_{\text{standard}}$ [S1, unofficial].
 
